{"1393270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "12 bananas", "steam_appid": 1393270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "The unfortunately frail Banana Boi has lost all 12 of his bananas! Can you help him get them back? Embark on an epic quest and travel the patience-testing path that lies ahead in this infuriatingly challenging, unforgiving, puzzling, memey platformer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt will not be easy. Many confusing, life-threatening hazards lie between you and your goal. There is no pausing or saving, and no extra lives are granted for most of the game— be wary! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Experience the satisfaction of finding each hidden banana<br />\r\n-Unveil the mystery of many different areas of various tricky terrains<br />\r\n-Defy loosely observed laws of nature with floating arrows, flying magnets, and really annoying trampolines<br />\r\n-Unlock Steamworks achievements and race the clock to beat previous completion times (should you exhibit the patience to finish at least once)", "about_the_game": "The unfortunately frail Banana Boi has lost all 12 of his bananas! Can you help him get them back? Embark on an epic quest and travel the patience-testing path that lies ahead in this infuriatingly challenging, unforgiving, puzzling, memey platformer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt will not be easy. Many confusing, life-threatening hazards lie between you and your goal. There is no pausing or saving, and no extra lives are granted for most of the game— be wary! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Experience the satisfaction of finding each hidden banana<br />\r\n-Unveil the mystery of many different areas of various tricky terrains<br />\r\n-Defy loosely observed laws of nature with floating arrows, flying magnets, and really annoying trampolines<br />\r\n-Unlock Steamworks achievements and race the clock to beat previous completion times (should you exhibit the patience to finish at least once)", "short_description": "Leap over treacherous c